/* 零工惩罚线：6 条路线 × 三级失误 / 18 passages / 只给警告、停优待、短暂停班，不扣现有钱 */

:: MP Job Punishment Cafe 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpJobCafeP1Out>>
	<<print $mpJobCafeP1Out>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[返回吧台 (0:01)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 1>><<set $mpJobCafeP1Out to "">><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpJobCafeStrike to Math.max(($mpJobCafeStrike or 0), 1)>>
	午市的最后一波客人刚走，托盘还烫着手。拐角那张桌子底下，三只杯子碎在砖地上，奶咖顺着砖缝往门口淌。
	<br><br>
	<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>蹲下去，把瓷片一片片捡进围裙兜，声音没有抬高：「今天这班没有工钱。」他站起来，用脚尖把最靠门、风口正对着的那四桌圈给你，「先把那儿擦干净。客人进门第一眼看见的就是它。」
	<br><br>
	<<if ($english or 0) gte 240>><<socialiseicon>><<link [[解释地滑|MP Job Punishment Cafe 1]]>><<if ($english or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpJobCafeP1Out to "你把话说得很慢：地刚拖过，托盘又堆得太满，你来不及绕。" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")) ? "格威岚" : "杂货店主") + "听完，把最后一片瓷丢进桶里：「下次绕着走。工钱照旧没有，明天还来。」">><<stress 1>><<else>><<set $mpJobCafeP1Out to "你越说越快，把排班和拖地的事都扯了进去。" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")) ? "格威岚" : "杂货店主") + "没打断，只把拖把递到你手里。你低头擦到水凉，鞋尖一直是湿的。">><<stress 4>><</if>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>><<walkicon>><span class="disabled">解释地滑（应对不足）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<tendingicon>><<link [[认错擦地|MP Job Punishment Cafe 1]]>><<set $mpJobCafeP1Out to "你没再解释，蹲下去把奶咖一点点吸进抹布，碎瓷按大小分开放。" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")) ? "格威岚" : "杂货店主") + "在旁边看了一会儿，临走前把一只干净杯子放在你手边。">><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><<pass 7>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 260>><<link [[出言顶撞|MP Job Punishment Cafe 1]]>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpJobCafeP1Out to "你直起腰，说排班本来就缺人，一个人看八桌迟早要出事。" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")) ? "格威岚" : "杂货店主") + "盯了你两秒，把靠门那四桌划掉，改成靠窗的两桌。">><<stress 1>><<else>><<set $mpJobCafeP1Out to "话出口就重了。" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")) ? "格威岚" : "杂货店主") + "没回嘴，只把围裙从钩子上取下来，搭在自己臂弯里。后厨安静得能听见水槽滴水。">><<stress 5>><<tiredness 1>><</if>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">出言顶撞（应对不足）</span><</if>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Punishment Cafe 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpJobCafeP2Out>>
	<<print $mpJobCafeP2Out>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[返回吧台 (0:01)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 1>><<set $mpJobCafeP2Out to "">><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpJobCafeStrike to Math.max(($mpJobCafeStrike or 0), 2)>><<set $mpJobCafePenalty to 1>><<set $mpJobCafePerk to 0>>
	第二天你刚系上围裙，<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>就把那只缺口的杯子从你惯用的位置收走，放回最高一层架子。
	<br><br>
	「先用公杯。」他说得很快，像怕自己改口。吧台尽头那张写着你名字的便条也被撕下来，团成一团。今天照常上工，只是那只缺口的杯子和熟客的便利先收走。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[补一个晚班|MP Job Punishment Cafe 2]]>><<set $mpJobCafeP2Out to "你留下来把后厨的排水沟刷了一遍，又把明天的杯具备齐。" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")) ? "格威岚" : "杂货店主") + "关灯时看了你一眼，在工钱簿那道横线上补了一笔。">><<set $mpJobCafePenalty to 0>><<stress 2>><<tiredness 4>><<pass 18>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 260>><<socialiseicon>><<link [[请熟客美言|MP Job Punishment Cafe 2]]>><<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpJobCafeP2Out to "你把那天的事说得很轻，没有推给别人。熟客结账时多留了一句。第二天，缺口杯子回到了你惯用的位置。">><<set $mpJobCafePerk to 1>><<stress 1>><<else>><<set $mpJobCafeP2Out to "熟客听完只是笑笑，把话题岔开。" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")) ? "格威岚" : "杂货店主") + "在吧台后头听见了半句，没抬头，手里的抹布停了一下。">><<stress 4>><</if>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<<else>><<investigateicon>><span class="disabled">请熟客美言（应对不足）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 280>><<link [[闷头做干净|MP Job Punishment Cafe 2]]>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 280>><<set $mpJobCafeP2Out to "你绷着肩端了一天盘子，桌面擦得能照出灯影。" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")) ? "格威岚" : "杂货店主") + "交班时把工钱数给你，手指在缺口杯子上停了停。">><<stress 1>><<else>><<set $mpJobCafeP2Out to "你绷着脸端了一天盘子，最后一桌的汤洒在袖口。" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")) ? "格威岚" : "杂货店主") + "什么也没说，只把拖把留在门口。">><<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><</if>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">闷头做干净（应对不足）</span><</if>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Punishment Cafe 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpJobCafeP3Out>>
	<<print $mpJobCafeP3Out>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:01)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 1>><<set $mpJobCafeP3Out to "">><</link>>
	<<if $mpJobCafeSuspended is 1>>
		<br>
		<<walkicon>><<link [[再试一次 (0:02)|MP Job Punishment Cafe 3]]>><<pass 2>><<set $mpJobCafeP3Out to "">><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpJobCafeStrike to 3>><<set $mpJobCafeSuspended to 1>>
	<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>在门口等你，围裙没有递过来。「这几天你先别来了。」他说这话时看着街面，不看你。
	<br><br>
	柜台上压着一张送货单。孤儿院订的黑麦面包，要有人送过去，再把回执带回来。他把单子往你这边推了推，纸角被风掀起又落下。
	<br><br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[送面包换回执|MP Job Punishment Cafe 3]]>><<set $mpJobCafeP3Out to "你把两筐面包送到孤儿院后门，等管事在回执上按了手印。回来时天已经擦黑，" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")) ? "格威岚" : "杂货店主") + "接过单子看了很久，把围裙从钩子上取下来递给你：「明天午市，老位置。」">><<set $mpJobCafeStrike to 0>><<set $mpJobCafeSuspended to 0>><<set $mpJobCafePenalty to 0>><<stress 1>><<tiredness 3>><<pass 25>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<if ($maths or 0) gte 260>><<investigateicon>><<link [[对平旧账|MP Job Punishment Cafe 3]]>><<if ($maths or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpJobCafeP3Out to "你把进货、赊账和找零一笔笔对平，最后差的那几便士是铅笔写错了位。" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")) ? "格威岚" : "杂货店主") + "用指节敲了敲账本，把围裙推过来，什么也没多问。">><<set $mpJobCafeStrike to 0>><<set $mpJobCafeSuspended to 0>><<set $mpJobCafePenalty to 0>><<stress -1>><<pass 20>><<else>><<set $mpJobCafeP3Out to "你算到第三遍还是对不上，账页被橡皮擦得发毛。" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")) ? "格威岚" : "杂货店主") + "把账本合上：「先回去吧。」">><<stress 5>><<pass 20>><</if>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">对平旧账（技艺不足）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 260>><<link [[洗净围裙|MP Job Punishment Cafe 3]]>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpJobCafeP3Out to "你把围裙泡进热水，领口的油渍一点点搓掉，又用熨斗压平。" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")) ? "格威岚" : "杂货店主") + "接过去抖开，对着光看了看，重新递给你。">><<set $mpJobCafeStrike to 0>><<set $mpJobCafeSuspended to 0>><<set $mpJobCafePenalty to 0>><<stress 1>><<tiredness 2>><<pass 20>><<else>><<set $mpJobCafeP3Out to "油渍没洗掉，反而晕开一大片。" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")) ? "格威岚" : "杂货店主") + "把围裙收回去，说自己来，让你先回家。">><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<pass 20>><</if>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">洗净围裙（技艺不足）</span><</if>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Punishment Fish 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpJobFishP1Out>>
	<<print $mpJobFishP1Out>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[返回栈桥 (0:01)|MP Job Fish]]>><<pass 1>><<set $mpJobFishP1Out to "">><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpJobFishStrike to Math.max(($mpJobFishStrike or 0), 1)>>
	退潮后的栈桥湿得发亮。你把最后一筐杂鱼拖上秤，绳结在半路松了，鱼撒了一地，几条顺着木板缝滑进水里。
	<br><br>
	鱼贩蹲下去捡，手背上的旧疤绷得发白。「这班不算钱。」他声音很粗，没骂人，只把最里侧那个太阳晒不到、风也吹不到的摊位踢给你，「明天起你在这儿杀鱼。」
	<br><br>
	<<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 260>><<socialiseicon>><<link [[解释绳结|MP Job Punishment Fish 1]]>><<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpJobFishP1Out to "你把声音放低，说绳结泡了一夜海水，早就发脆。鱼贩哼了一声，把新绳扔到你脚边：「换掉。下回再散，你自己下水分。」">><<stress 1>><<else>><<set $mpJobFishP1Out to "你解释到一半，鱼贩已经转身去拖冰筐。海风把你的话吹散，没人接。">><<stress 4>><</if>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>><<walkicon>><span class="disabled">解释绳结（应对不足）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<if ($tending or 0) gte 240>><<tendingicon>><<link [[认错补网|MP Job Punishment Fish 1]]>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpJobFishP1Out to "你蹲在缆桩旁把网脚重新走了一遍线，结打得很紧。鱼贩过来扯了扯，没扯动，把一只小一点的筐放回你手边。">><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><<pass 9>><<else>><<set $mpJobFishP1Out to "线拉得太急，网眼皱成一团，梭子还扎进指腹。鱼贩看了一眼，把网收走，让你先去冲地。">><<pain 1>><<stress 4>><<pass 9>><</if>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">认错补网（技艺不足）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 280>><<link [[分辩竹筐漏|MP Job Punishment Fish 1]]>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 280>><<set $mpJobFishP1Out to "你没低头，说框底早就裂了，换谁拖都得散。鱼贩盯了你一会儿，把烟头在栏杆上摁灭：「明天换新框。你也别迟到。」">><<stress 1>><<else>><<set $mpJobFishP1Out to "你顶了两句，鱼贩把秤砣往台上一放，声音不大，整条栈桥都静了。你最后自己把鱼一条条捡回框里。">><<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><</if>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">分辩竹筐漏（应对不足）</span><</if>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Punishment Fish 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpJobFishP2Out>>
	<<print $mpJobFishP2Out>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[返回栈桥 (0:01)|MP Job Fish]]>><<pass 1>><<set $mpJobFishP2Out to "">><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpJobFishStrike to Math.max(($mpJobFishStrike or 0), 2)>><<set $mpJobFishPenalty to 1>><<set $mpJobFishStall to 0>>
	第二天你到码头，靠海风那一侧的摊位已经摆上了别人的木牌，碎冰也铺好了。你的筐被挪到日头底下，鱼鳞晒得发白。
	<br><br>
	鱼贩从你身边走过，只丢下一句：「这趟按老规矩，先给你最差的筐。」他没有停脚，靴底在湿木板上留下一串水印。
	<br><br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[留下卸船|MP Job Punishment Fish 2]]>><<set $mpJobFishP2Out to "夜里的船比白天重。你和他们一起把箱子从跳板抬上来，肩膀磨出一道红痕。鱼贩收工前把明天靠风口的木牌挪回你这边。">><<set $mpJobFishPenalty to 0>><<stress 2>><<tiredness 4>><<pass 20>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 260>><<socialiseicon>><<link [[找老工说情|MP Job Punishment Fish 2]]>><<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpJobFishP2Out to "老码头工蹲在石阶上抽完一支烟，起身去跟鱼贩说了几句。第二天你的筐回到了阴凉处，只是最差的那只还在角落里。">><<stress 1>><<else>><<set $mpJobFishP2Out to "老码头工听完摆摆手，说鱼贩的脾气比潮水还硬。你站在日头底下，看自己的影子一点点缩短。">><<stress 4>><</if>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<<else>><<walkicon>><span class="disabled">找老工说情（应对不足）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 280>><<link [[独揽重活|MP Job Punishment Fish 2]]>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 280>><<set $mpJobFishP2Out to "你一声不吭，把最重的冰筐一趟趟拖上秤，手掌磨得发亮。鱼贩看了半天，收工时把最差的筐换成了靠里的。">><<stress 1>><<tiredness 3>><<else>><<set $mpJobFishP2Out to "你硬撑到下午，腰先塌了。鱼贩让你去棚子里歇着，最差的筐一趟没少。">><<stress 5>><<tiredness 4>><</if>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">独揽重活（应对不足）</span><</if>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Punishment Fish 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpJobFishP3Out>>
	<<print $mpJobFishP3Out>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[返回码头 (0:01)|MP Job Fish]]>><<pass 1>><<set $mpJobFishP3Out to "">><</link>>
	<<if $mpJobFishSuspended is 1>>
		<br>
		<<runicon>><<link [[再试一次 (0:02)|MP Job Punishment Fish 3]]>><<pass 2>><<set $mpJobFishP3Out to "">><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpJobFishStrike to 3>><<set $mpJobFishSuspended to 1>>
	鱼贩把一捆缆绳甩上肩，背对着你：「这几天别来了，省得我看着心烦。」
	<br><br>
	他走了两步，又回头，把一张湿软的提货单塞进你手里。酒馆订的一箱咸鱼，要送到后门，把空箱和回执带回来。单子边角被海水泡得发软。
	<br><br>
	<<link [[送咸鱼换回执|MP Job Punishment Fish 3]]>><<set $mpJobFishP3Out to "你把木箱扛到酒馆后门，等厨子清点完，把空箱和回执一起带回来。鱼贩看完回执，把摊位上的碎冰重新铲平：「明早潮前到。」">><<set $mpJobFishStrike to 0>><<set $mpJobFishSuspended to 0>><<set $mpJobFishPenalty to 0>><<stress 1>><<tiredness 3>><<pass 25>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<if ($tending or 0) gte 260>><<tendingicon>><<link [[天亮前补网|MP Job Punishment Fish 3]]>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpJobFishP3Out to "你在灯下把整张网的破口一格格补好，线头全部收进网结里。天亮时鱼贩把网抖开，对着光看了一遍，没挑出毛病。">><<set $mpJobFishStrike to 0>><<set $mpJobFishSuspended to 0>><<set $mpJobFishPenalty to 0>><<stress 2>><<tiredness 4>><<pass 30>><<else>><<set $mpJobFishP3Out to "补到一半，线用完了。你坐在半张破网旁边等天亮，手指被勒出一道道白痕。鱼贩来的时候只看了一眼。">><<stress 5>><<tiredness 4>><<pass 30>><</if>><</link>>
<<else>><<walkicon>><span class="disabled">天亮前补网（技艺不足）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 280>><<link [[趁退潮拖船|MP Job Punishment Fish 3]]>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 280>><<set $mpJobFishP3Out to "你把缆绳绕上腰，踩着湿沙一步一步把船拖回潮线。鱼贩在岸上看着，最后走过来搭了一把手，什么也没说。">><<set $mpJobFishStrike to 0>><<set $mpJobFishSuspended to 0>><<set $mpJobFishPenalty to 0>><<stress 2>><<tiredness 5>><<pass 22>><<else>><<set $mpJobFishP3Out to "船底陷进沙里，你拖了两步就滑倒，裤腿全湿了。潮水已经开始回涨，鱼贩让你先上来。">><<stress 5>><<tiredness 3>><<pass 22>><</if>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">趁退潮拖船（力气不足）</span><</if>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Punishment Spa 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "spa">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpJobSpaP1Out>>
	<<print $mpJobSpaP1Out>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[返回池边 (0:01)|MP Job Spa]]>><<pass 1>><<set $mpJobSpaP1Out to "">><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpJobSpaStrike to Math.max(($mpJobSpaStrike or 0), 1)>>
	冷水阀开得太久，池边的雾气散了一层。那位客人的肩膀被烫出一片红，没吭声，只在起身时扶了一下石沿。
	<br><br>
	<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>把毛巾叠好，声音很平：「这班没有工钱。」他指了指打烊后要刷的冷水池，「今晚你留下，把池底的青苔刮干净。明天先看水，不接客人。」
	<br><br>
	<<if ($tending or 0) gte 260>><<tendingicon>><<link [[解释阀门|MP Job Punishment Spa 1]]>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpJobSpaP1Out to "你把水温表和阀门的事说清楚，没有把责任推给客人。" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")) ? "乔丹" : "神殿修士") + "去拧了拧那个阀，确认它确实卡了半圈，回来把班表上的名字往后挪了一格。">><<stress 1>><<else>><<set $mpJobSpaP1Out to "你说了几句，越说越像在找借口。" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")) ? "乔丹" : "神殿修士") + "没有反驳，只把刮青苔的铜铲放到你手边。">><<stress 4>><</if>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>><<walkicon>><span class="disabled">解释阀门（技艺不足）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[认错刷池|MP Job Punishment Spa 1]]>><<set $mpJobSpaP1Out to "你等最后一盏铜灯熄了，卷起裤脚下去刷池底。青苔滑得站不住，你扶着石沿一点点刮。" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")) ? "乔丹" : "神殿修士") + "走前在池边留了一杯温水。">><<stress 2>><<tiredness 4>><<pass 20>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 260>><<link [[顶嘴抱怨|MP Job Punishment Spa 1]]>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpJobSpaP1Out to "你把话说完，没有提高声音。" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")) ? "乔丹" : "神殿修士") + "沉默了一会儿，承认今晚确实只排了一个人，把明早的班表添了半个人手。">><<stress 1>><<else>><<set $mpJobSpaP1Out to "你的话在蒸汽里显得很硬。" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")) ? "乔丹" : "神殿修士") + "只回了一句：「我知道。」然后转身去关池边的灯，留你一个人站在原地。">><<stress 5>><</if>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">顶嘴抱怨（应对不足）</span><</if>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Punishment Spa 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "spa">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpJobSpaP2Out>>
	<<print $mpJobSpaP2Out>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[返回池边 (0:01)|MP Job Spa]]>><<pass 1>><<set $mpJobSpaP2Out to "">><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpJobSpaStrike to Math.max(($mpJobSpaStrike or 0), 2)>><<set $mpJobSpaPenalty to 1>><<set $mpJobSpaPrivate to 0>>
	第二天私汤门边的木牌翻到了另一个名字。你的铜钥匙被收回，挂在柜台后面的钉子上，碰一下就响。
	<br><br>
	<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>把你的班次往后排了一格，水温和毛巾照旧，只是不再让你单独看私汤。「这阵子先按普通班算。」他说得很轻，像在替你把话咽回去。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[提早烧水|MP Job Punishment Spa 2]]>><<set $mpJobSpaP2Out to "你天没亮就到，把三池水一锅锅烧到合适，又把毛巾按大小码好。" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")) ? "乔丹" : "神殿修士") + "来的时候，私汤的铜钥匙已经放回你手边。">><<set $mpJobSpaPenalty to 0>><<stress 2>><<tiredness 4>><<pass 20>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>><<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 260>><<link [[请老客美言|MP Job Punishment Spa 2]]>><<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpJobSpaP2Out to "老客人裹着浴巾靠在池边，听你把话说完，只点了点头。当天下午，私汤的木牌重新翻回你的名字。">><<set $mpJobSpaPrivate to 1>><<stress 1>><<else>><<set $mpJobSpaP2Out to "老客人听了一半就闭上眼，说水太热。你退到池边，把话咽了回去。">><<stress 4>><</if>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<<else>><<investigateicon>><span class="disabled">请老客美言（应对不足）</span><</if>><<else>><span class="disabled">请老客美言（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 280>><<link [[把活做细|MP Job Punishment Spa 2]]>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 280>><<set $mpJobSpaP2Out to "你一整天没提私汤的事，递巾、看水、清排水口，一步一步做完。交班时" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")) ? "乔丹" : "神殿修士") + "把私汤的木牌还了回来。">><<stress 1>><<tiredness 2>><<else>><<set $mpJobSpaP2Out to "你越想把普通班做好，手越急。一条毛巾掉进池里，你捞了很久，最后连自己都觉得狼狈。">><<stress 5>><<tiredness 3>><</if>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">把活做细（应对不足）</span><</if>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Punishment Spa 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "spa">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpJobSpaP3Out>>
	<<print $mpJobSpaP3Out>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[返回更衣室 (0:01)|MP Job Spa]]>><<pass 1>><<set $mpJobSpaP3Out to "">><</link>>
	<<if $mpJobSpaSuspended is 1>>
		<br>
		<<walkicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>><<socialiseicon>><<link [[再试一次 (0:02)|MP Job Punishment Spa 3]]>><<pass 2>><<set $mpJobSpaP3Out to "">><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">再试一次 (0:02)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpJobSpaStrike to 3>><<set $mpJobSpaSuspended to 1>>
	<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>在更衣室门口拦下你，手里拿着你叠好的制服。「先歇几天。」他把制服放在长凳上，没有递过来。
	<br><br>
	「神殿那边订了一批干毛巾。」他看了看走廊尽头，「你替我送过去，把签收单带回来。剩下的我们再说。」
	<br><br>
	<<templeicon>><<link [[送毛巾换签单|MP Job Punishment Spa 3]]>><<set $mpJobSpaP3Out to "你把两捆干毛巾送到神殿侧门，等执事清点完，把签收单折好带回来。" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")) ? "乔丹" : "神殿修士") + "看完单子，把制服重新递给你：「明早的班，别再走神。」">><<set $mpJobSpaStrike to 0>><<set $mpJobSpaSuspended to 0>><<set $mpJobSpaPenalty to 0>><<stress 1>><<tiredness 3>><<pass 25>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<if ($tending or 0) gte 280>><<link [[刷通铜管|MP Job Punishment Spa 3]]>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 280>><<set $mpJobSpaP3Out to "你把铜管拆下来，用细刷一点点通开结垢，又用醋水泡过，水声终于顺畅。" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")) ? "乔丹" : "神殿修士") + "试了试水温，把钥匙放回你掌心。">><<set $mpJobSpaStrike to 0>><<set $mpJobSpaSuspended to 0>><<set $mpJobSpaPenalty to 0>><<stress 2>><<tiredness 3>><<pass 25>><<else>><<set $mpJobSpaP3Out to "铜管里的垢比想象中硬，刷到一半刷柄断了。你把水关掉，坐在池边，手上全是醋味。">><<stress 5>><<tiredness 3>><<pass 25>><</if>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">刷通铜管（技艺不足）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>><<if ($english or 0) gte 260>><<link [[写信请乔丹|MP Job Punishment Spa 3]]>><<if ($english or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpJobSpaP3Out to "你把那天水温的事写清楚，没有推托，也没有过分自贬。" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")) ? "乔丹" : "神殿修士") + "读完，把信折好收进袖口，说他会转交，还说明天的班照旧。">><<set $mpJobSpaStrike to 0>><<set $mpJobSpaSuspended to 0>><<set $mpJobSpaPenalty to 0>><<stress 1>><<pass 20>><<else>><<set $mpJobSpaP3Out to "你写了两行就停住，纸上全是划掉的字。" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")) ? "乔丹" : "神殿修士") + "看了一眼，把纸对折，说等你想清楚再写。">><<stress 4>><<pass 20>><</if>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">写信请乔丹（应对不足）</span><</if>><<else>><span class="disabled">写信请乔丹（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Punishment Farm 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpJobFarmP1Out>>
	<<print $mpJobFarmP1Out>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[返回田埂 (0:01)|MP Job Farm]]>><<pass 1>><<set $mpJobFarmP1Out to "">><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpJobFarmStrike to Math.max(($mpJobFarmStrike or 0), 1)>>
	你拔开渠口的木闸，水比预想的急。低处那畦刚出的苗被冲得东倒西歪，泥水漫过田埂，一直淌到路上。
	<br><br>
	<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>站在埂上看完，把铁锹插进泥里。「这班没有工钱。」他指了指最远、石头最多的那畦，「明天你去那边，先把石头捡干净。什么时候捡完，什么时候再碰水闸。」
	<br><br>
	<<if ($tending or 0) gte 260>><<tendingicon>><<link [[解释土裂|MP Job Punishment Farm 1]]>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpJobFarmP1Out to "你蹲下去，把裂开的土面和渠底的高低指给" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")) ? "亚历克斯" : "年轻农夫") + "看。他看了很久，承认这道埂本来就该加高，让你明天先跟他一起修渠。">><<stress 1>><<else>><<set $mpJobFarmP1Out to "你说得越多，" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")) ? "亚历克斯" : "年轻农夫") + "的眉头越紧。最后他把铁锹拔出来，让你先去把路上的泥铲回畦里。">><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><</if>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>><<walkicon>><span class="disabled">解释土裂（技艺不足）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[认错修埂|MP Job Punishment Farm 1]]>><<set $mpJobFarmP1Out to "你把冲散的土一锹一锹培回埂上，又用脚背踩实。天黑前，水终于被挡回渠里。" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")) ? "亚历克斯" : "年轻农夫") + "收工前在你旁边放了一壶水。">><<stress 2>><<tiredness 5>><<pass 20>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 280>><<link [[顶嘴推脱|MP Job Punishment Farm 1]]>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 280>><<set $mpJobFarmP1Out to "你把话说完，站在泥里没退。" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")) ? "亚历克斯" : "年轻农夫") + "盯了你一会儿，忽然弯腰把渠口的木闸拔高了一格：「你说得对。明天一起改。」">><<stress 1>><<else>><<set $mpJobFarmP1Out to "" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")) ? "亚历克斯" : "年轻农夫") + "没跟你争，只把铁锹横在渠口，自己走了。你一个人站在漫水的田里，听见远处鸡叫。">><<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><</if>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">顶嘴推脱（应对不足）</span><</if>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Punishment Farm 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpJobFarmP2Out>>
	<<print $mpJobFarmP2Out>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[返回田埂 (0:01)|MP Job Farm]]>><<pass 1>><<set $mpJobFarmP2Out to "">><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpJobFarmStrike to Math.max(($mpJobFarmStrike or 0), 2)>><<set $mpJobFarmPenalty to 1>><<set $mpJobFarmGreenhouse to 0>>
	第二天温室门上的钥匙换了位置。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>把它挂回自己腰间，没有看你：「这阵子育苗我来。你先管露天的畦。」
	<br><br>
	这季最远的畦也归你。他把话说得很直，没有绕弯，说完就去搬草料了。
	<br><br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[补木篱笆|MP Job Punishment Farm 2]]>><<set $mpJobFarmP2Out to "你摸黑把西边松动的篱笆桩一根根夯紧，又补上新铁丝。" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")) ? "亚历克斯" : "年轻农夫") + "来时沿着篱笆走了一圈，把温室钥匙解下来，放回门边的钉子上。">><<set $mpJobFarmPenalty to 0>><<stress 2>><<tiredness 5>><<pass 22>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<if ($english or 0) gte 260>><<socialiseicon>><<link [[请老农说情|MP Job Punishment Farm 2]]>><<if ($english or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpJobFarmP2Out to "老农在田埂上跟" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")) ? "亚历克斯" : "年轻农夫") + "抽了一支烟，说的话不多。第二天最远的畦换回了近处，温室的门也留了一条缝。">><<stress 1>><<else>><<set $mpJobFarmP2Out to "老农听完只说" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")) ? "亚历克斯" : "年轻农夫") + "的脾气像石头。你站在篱笆外，看着他走远。">><<stress 4>><</if>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>><<walkicon>><span class="disabled">请老农说情（应对不足）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 280>><<link [[包揽重活|MP Job Punishment Farm 2]]>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 280>><<set $mpJobFarmP2Out to "你一个人把草料棚清空又码满，肩膀被麻绳勒出两道印。" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")) ? "亚历克斯" : "年轻农夫") + "收工时看了你一眼，说明天不用去最远的畦。">><<stress 1>><<tiredness 4>><<else>><<set $mpJobFarmP2Out to "活太重，你到下午就直不起腰。" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")) ? "亚历克斯" : "年轻农夫") + "让你去棚里坐着，什么也没多说。">><<stress 5>><<tiredness 4>><</if>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">包揽重活（应对不足）</span><</if>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Punishment Farm 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpJobFarmP3Out>>
	<<print $mpJobFarmP3Out>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[返回谷仓 (0:01)|MP Job Farm]]>><<pass 1>><<set $mpJobFarmP3Out to "">><</link>>
	<<if $mpJobFarmSuspended is 1>>
		<br>
		<<walkicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>><<socialiseicon>><<link [[再试一次 (0:02)|MP Job Punishment Farm 3]]>><<pass 2>><<set $mpJobFarmP3Out to "">><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">再试一次 (0:02)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpJobFarmStrike to 3>><<set $mpJobFarmSuspended to 1>>
	<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>把谷仓门拉下一半，铁链在门框上磕了一声。「这几天你不用来了。」
	<br><br>
	他从口袋里摸出一张折过的种子单，从门缝递出来：「商店还欠我一袋黑麦种。你去把单子对清楚，拿回盖章的收据。拿回来再说。」
	<br><br>
	<<shopicon>><<link [[核对种子单|MP Job Punishment Farm 3]]>><<set $mpJobFarmP3Out to "你对照种子单把袋数和价钱一项项核过，等店主盖上章。回来时" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")) ? "亚历克斯" : "年轻农夫") + "把门拉开，接过收据折好：「明早来，先把水渠看了。」">><<set $mpJobFarmStrike to 0>><<set $mpJobFarmSuspended to 0>><<set $mpJobFarmPenalty to 0>><<stress 1>><<tiredness 3>><<pass 25>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 280>><<link [[清淤排水沟|MP Job Punishment Farm 3]]>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 280>><<set $mpJobFarmP3Out to "你把沟底的淤泥和碎石一锹锹甩上岸，又用木尺找平。水重新流走的时候，" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")) ? "亚历克斯" : "年轻农夫") + "站在埂上点了点头，把谷仓门完全拉开。">><<set $mpJobFarmStrike to 0>><<set $mpJobFarmSuspended to 0>><<set $mpJobFarmPenalty to 0>><<stress 2>><<tiredness 5>><<pass 30>><<else>><<set $mpJobFarmP3Out to "沟挖到一半就塌了，泥水又漫回来。你站在齐踝的泥里，手心磨出了水泡。">><<stress 5>><<tiredness 4>><<pass 30>><</if>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">清淤排水沟（力气不足）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 260>><<link [[帮看母羊|MP Job Punishment Farm 3]]>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpJobFarmP3Out to "你按" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")) ? "亚历克斯" : "年轻农夫") + "教的法子把母羊按住，等小羊落地，又把脐带处理干净。" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")) ? "亚历克斯" : "年轻农夫") + "洗手时说了句：「明天来。」">><<set $mpJobFarmStrike to 0>><<set $mpJobFarmSuspended to 0>><<set $mpJobFarmPenalty to 0>><<stress 2>><<tiredness 3>><<pass 28>><<else>><<set $mpJobFarmP3Out to "你按不住那只母羊，最后还是" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")) ? "亚历克斯" : "年轻农夫") + "一个人弄完。他没赶你走，只让你先回去。">><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<pass 28>><</if>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">帮看母羊（技艺不足）</span><</if>><<else>><span class="disabled">帮看母羊（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
