:: MP Job Punishment Clock 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpJobClockP1Out>>
	<<print $mpJobClockP1Out>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[返回工作台 (0:01)|MP Job Clock]]>><<pass 1>><<set $mpJobClockP1Out to "">><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpJobClockStrike to Math.max(($mpJobClockStrike or 0), 1)>>
	镊子尖一滑，游丝在放大镜下弹了一下，断了。客人的银壳怀表停在你手心里，秒针卡在原来的位置。
	<br><br>
	<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>把断掉的游丝夹进废料盒，声音没有起伏：「这班不算工钱。」她把一盒积灰的旧壳推到你面前，「今天先把这些零件按型号分好。客人的表，明天再碰。」
	<br><br>
	<<if ($maths or 0) gte 260>><<investigateicon>><<link [[解释游丝|MP Job Punishment Clock 1]]>><<if ($maths or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpJobClockP1Out to "你把游丝断口的角度和暗裂的位置指给" + (($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet) ? "塞拉" : "修表师") + "看，说得有条有理。她用放大镜看了一会儿，把客人那块表推回你面前：「明天重装。慢一点。」">><<stress 1>><<else>><<set $mpJobClockP1Out to "你说了几处可能的原因，越说越不确定。" + (($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet) ? "塞拉" : "修表师") + "没接话，只把零件盒往你这边推了推。">><<stress 4>><</if>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>><<walkicon>><span class="disabled">解释游丝（技艺不足）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<tendingicon>><<link [[认错分拣|MP Job Punishment Clock 1]]>><<set $mpJobClockP1Out to "你把旧壳里的摆轮、齿轮和宝石轴承拆出来，按大小排进绒布槽，一直分到铺子打烊。" + (($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet) ? "塞拉" : "修表师") + "关灯前看了一眼，没挑出错。">><<stress 2>><<tiredness 3>><<pass 20>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 280>><<link [[顶嘴怪旧表|MP Job Punishment Clock 1]]>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 280>><<set $mpJobClockP1Out to "你把话说完，没有把镊子放下。" + (($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet) ? "塞拉" : "修表师") + "沉默了几秒，从抽屉里取出一只新游丝放到你手边：「那就换。你装给我看。」">><<stress 1>><<else>><<set $mpJobClockP1Out to "你的声音在安静的铺子里显得很响。" + (($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet) ? "塞拉" : "修表师") + "只把废料盒盖上，说今天到这里。">><<stress 5>><</if>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">顶嘴怪旧表（应对不足）</span><</if>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Punishment Clock 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpJobClockP2Out>>
	<<print $mpJobClockP2Out>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[返回工作台 (0:01)|MP Job Clock]]>><<pass 1>><<set $mpJobClockP2Out to "">><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpJobClockStrike to Math.max(($mpJobClockStrike or 0), 2)>><<set $mpJobClockPenalty to 1>><<set $mpJobClockCommission to 0>>
	第二天，委托栏上那块刻着你名字的小铜牌不见了。原来压着客人姓名的纸条被挪到<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>自己的工作台上。
	<br><br>
	「这阵子委托我来接。」她把你手边的放大镜收进抽屉，「你先把基础活做稳。委托先不给你接。」
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[盘点库存|MP Job Punishment Clock 2]]>><<set $mpJobClockP2Out to "你把库存一盒盒倒出来，按型号、磨损和可用性重新登记。" + (($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet) ? "塞拉" : "修表师") + "核了一遍账，在工钱簿上把你的名字挪回原来的那栏。">><<set $mpJobClockPenalty to 0>><<stress 2>><<tiredness 3>><<pass 20>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<if ($english or 0) gte 260>><<link [[请主顾求情|MP Job Punishment Clock 2]]>><<if ($english or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpJobClockP2Out to "老客人取表时多留了一会儿，说他那只表跟了自己二十年，只信你们这间铺子。" + (($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet) ? "塞拉" : "修表师") + "听完，把委托栏上的铜牌挂了回去。">><<set $mpJobClockCommission to 1>><<stress 1>><<else>><<set $mpJobClockP2Out to "你把话说得很客气，老客人只是点头，拿了表就走。" + (($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet) ? "塞拉" : "修表师") + "在柜台后头翻着账本，没有抬头。">><<stress 4>><</if>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<<else>><<walkicon>><span class="disabled">请主顾求情（应对不足）</span><</if>><<else>><span class="disabled">请主顾求情（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 280>><<link [[埋头做基础活|MP Job Punishment Clock 2]]>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 280>><<set $mpJobClockP2Out to "你一天没碰委托，只拆洗、上油、校准，每一只都记在簿子上。" + (($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet) ? "塞拉" : "修表师") + "收工时看了那页记录，把放大镜放回你手边。">><<stress 1>><<tiredness 2>><<else>><<set $mpJobClockP2Out to "你越想做稳，手越僵。一只表的后盖合了三次才到位，" + (($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet) ? "塞拉" : "修表师") + "在旁边看完了全程。">><<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><</if>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">埋头做基础活（应对不足）</span><</if>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Punishment Clock 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpJobClockP3Out>>
	<<print $mpJobClockP3Out>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[返回铺子 (0:01)|MP Job Clock]]>><<pass 1>><<set $mpJobClockP3Out to "">><</link>>
	<<if $mpJobClockSuspended is 1>>
		<br>
		<<walkicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<socialiseicon>><<link [[再试一次 (0:02)|MP Job Punishment Clock 3]]>><<pass 2>><<set $mpJobClockP3Out to "">><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">再试一次 (0:02)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpJobClockStrike to 3>><<set $mpJobClockSuspended to 1>>
	<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>把工作台的灯关了，只留柜台上的一盏。「休息几天。」她把你的镊子收进木盒，扣上搭扣。
	<br><br>
	「这只表修好了，客人住在高街另一头。」她把一只用绒布包好的怀表推过来，「替我送过去，把签收条带回来。做得到，再谈排班。」
	<br><br>
	<<link [[送表换回执|MP Job Punishment Clock 3]]>><<set $mpJobClockP3Out to "你穿过高街，把怀表交到客人手里，等对方试走了一圈，在签收条上签了字。" + (($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet) ? "塞拉" : "修表师") + "看完条子，把工作台的灯重新打开。">><<set $mpJobClockStrike to 0>><<set $mpJobClockSuspended to 0>><<set $mpJobClockPenalty to 0>><<stress 1>><<tiredness 2>><<pass 25>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<if ($maths or 0) gte 280>><<investigateicon>><<link [[装好机芯|MP Job Punishment Clock 3]]>><<if ($maths or 0) gte 280>><<set $mpJobClockP3Out to "你把摆轮、擒纵叉和轮系重新排了一遍，秒针终于走出一圈均匀的轻响。" + (($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet) ? "塞拉" : "修表师") + "凑近听了一会儿，把镊子放回你手边。">><<set $mpJobClockStrike to 0>><<set $mpJobClockSuspended to 0>><<set $mpJobClockPenalty to 0>><<stress 2>><<tiredness 3>><<pass 30>><<else>><<set $mpJobClockP3Out to "装到第三遍，仍有一只齿轮咬不上。你放下镊子，指尖在发颤。" + (($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet) ? "塞拉" : "修表师") + "把机芯收走，让你先回去。">><<stress 5>><<tiredness 3>><<pass 30>><</if>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">装好机芯（技艺不足）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<link [[翻找棘爪簧|MP Job Punishment Clock 3]]>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<set $mpJobClockP3Out to "你在废料盒底翻出一枚尺寸相近的棘爪簧，修整后装回去，机芯重新走起来。" + (($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet) ? "塞拉" : "修表师") + "看了看那枚簧，什么也没说，只把灯留给了你。">><<set $mpJobClockStrike to 0>><<set $mpJobClockSuspended to 0>><<set $mpJobClockPenalty to 0>><<stress 2>><<pass 28>><<else>><<set $mpJobClockP3Out to "废料盒里的零件太多，你翻了很久也没找到合适的。" + (($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet) ? "塞拉" : "修表师") + "把盒子盖上，说改天再找。">><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<pass 28>><</if>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">翻找棘爪簧（手法不足）</span><</if>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Punishment Laundry 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpJobLaundryP1Out>>
	<<print $mpJobLaundryP1Out>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[返回浆洗房 (0:01)|MP Job Laundry]]>><<pass 1>><<set $mpJobLaundryP1Out to "">><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpJobLaundryStrike to Math.max(($mpJobLaundryStrike or 0), 1)>>
	熨斗停得太久，白汽散开时，管事那条桌布上多了一块焦黄的印子，边缘还在发脆。
	<br><br>
	管事把桌布拎起来看了看，语气不重：「这班没有工钱。」<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>站在门口，怀里抱着的床单往下滑了一截，又被他抱紧。「今晚你把铜锅刷出来，」管事说，「明天开始先熨孩子们的旧衣服。」
	<br><br>
	<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>><<tendingicon>><<link [[解释毡薄|MP Job Punishment Laundry 1]]>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpJobLaundryP1Out to "你把熨台掀开，让管事看底下那块薄毡和翘起的木边。管事摸了摸，承认这张台子早该修，让" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")) ? "罗宾" : "熟识的院童") + "明天换一块新毡。">><<stress 1>><<else>><<set $mpJobLaundryP1Out to "你说了几句，管事只把焦掉的桌布叠起来，放到一旁。" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")) ? "罗宾" : "熟识的院童") + "低着头，没有说话。">><<stress 4>><</if>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>><<walkicon>><span class="disabled">解释毡薄（技艺不足）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[认错刷锅|MP Job Punishment Laundry 1]]>><<set $mpJobLaundryP1Out to "你蹲在铜锅前，用粗盐和醋把锅底的焦垢一层层磨掉，手臂酸得抬不起来。管事走前看了一眼，把明天的旧衣服减了半摞。">><<stress 2>><<tiredness 4>><<pass 20>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 260>><<link [[顶嘴说活多|MP Job Punishment Laundry 1]]>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpJobLaundryP1Out to "你把话说清楚，没有冲着" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")) ? "罗宾" : "熟识的院童") + "。管事听了一会儿，承认今天确实只排了一个人，把明早的班加了半个帮手。">><<stress 1>><<else>><<set $mpJobLaundryP1Out to "你的话在走廊里传开，" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")) ? "罗宾" : "熟识的院童") + "往后缩了缩。管事没有回嘴，只让你先把焦掉的桌布收走。">><<stress 5>><<tiredness 1>><</if>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">顶嘴说活多（应对不足）</span><</if>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Punishment Laundry 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpJobLaundryP2Out>>
	<<print $mpJobLaundryP2Out>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[返回浆洗房 (0:01)|MP Job Laundry]]>><<pass 1>><<set $mpJobLaundryP2Out to "">><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpJobLaundryStrike to Math.max(($mpJobLaundryStrike or 0), 2)>><<set $mpJobLaundryPenalty to 1>><<set $mpJobLaundryDiscount to 0>>
	价目表上你名字旁边那行「内部价」被划掉了。墨线很直，管事划的时候没有犹豫。
	<br><br>
	<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>站在装订台旁边，把一摞待修的旧书推了推，又推回去。他没敢看你，只说：「管事说，这阵子先接外面的活。」这一班最厚的床单归你。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[赶早浆洗床单|MP Job Punishment Laundry 2]]>><<set $mpJobLaundryP2Out to "你摸黑把第一批床单洗完、拧干、晾上，等管事来时，铜锅已经烧热了。他看了价目表一眼，用笔把划掉的那行重新描了回去。">><<set $mpJobLaundryPenalty to 0>><<stress 2>><<tiredness 4>><<pass 20>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<if ($english or 0) gte 260>><<link [[写字条给管事|MP Job Punishment Laundry 2]]>><<if ($english or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpJobLaundryP2Out to "你把那天熨台的事写得很短，没有推给" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")) ? "罗宾" : "熟识的院童") + "。管事看完条子，又看了看站在门口的" + (($NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")) ? "罗宾" : "熟识的院童") + "，把内部价恢复了。">><<set $mpJobLaundryDiscount to 1>><<stress 1>><<else>><<set $mpJobLaundryP2Out to "条子写得太急，字挤在一起。管事看完折起来，说知道了，别的没提。">><<stress 4>><</if>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<<else>><<investigateicon>><span class="disabled">写字条给管事（应对不足）</span><</if>><<else>><span class="disabled">写字条给管事（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 280>><<link [[默默接重活|MP Job Punishment Laundry 2]]>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 280>><<set $mpJobLaundryP2Out to "你一整天没离开浆洗房，把最厚的床单和桌布全洗了，手背泡得发白。管事收工时把装订台的钥匙放回原处。">><<stress 1>><<tiredness 4>><<else>><<set $mpJobLaundryP2Out to "你硬撑到下午，腰先撑不住。管事让你去走廊尽头坐一会儿，最厚的床单还压在盆里。">><<stress 5>><<tiredness 4>><</if>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">默默接重活（应对不足）</span><</if>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Punishment Laundry 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpJobLaundryP3Out>>
	<<print $mpJobLaundryP3Out>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[返回走廊 (0:01)|MP Job Laundry]]>><<pass 1>><<set $mpJobLaundryP3Out to "">><</link>>
	<<if $mpJobLaundrySuspended is 1>>
		<br>
		<<walkicon>><<link [[再试一次 (0:02)|MP Job Punishment Laundry 3]]>><<pass 2>><<set $mpJobLaundryP3Out to "">><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpJobLaundryStrike to 3>><<set $mpJobLaundrySuspended to 1>>
	管事把浆洗房的门掩上一半：「这几天你先别来了。」
	<br><br>
	<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>从门缝里递出一只布包，里面是神殿送来的法衣，叠得整整齐齐。「管事说，送到神殿侧门，把签收单带回来。」他顿了顿，「我替你把铜锅先看着。」
	<br><br>
	<<templeicon>><<link [[送法衣换签单|MP Job Punishment Laundry 3]]>><<set $mpJobLaundryP3Out to "你把法衣交到神殿侧门，等执事逐件点过，把签收单折好带回来。管事看完单子，把浆洗房的门完全推开：「明早来，先熨旧衣服。」">><<set $mpJobLaundryStrike to 0>><<set $mpJobLaundrySuspended to 0>><<set $mpJobLaundryPenalty to 0>><<stress 1>><<tiredness 3>><<pass 25>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 260>><<tendingicon>><<link [[装订账本|MP Job Punishment Laundry 3]]>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpJobLaundryP3Out to "你把松脱的账页按日期排好，重新穿线、上浆、压平。管事翻开看了看，纸页服帖，页脚对齐，把门边的围裙递给你。">><<set $mpJobLaundryStrike to 0>><<set $mpJobLaundrySuspended to 0>><<set $mpJobLaundryPenalty to 0>><<stress 1>><<tiredness 3>><<pass 25>><<else>><<set $mpJobLaundryP3Out to "线穿到一半就乱了，几页纸被浆糊粘在一起。你坐在装订台前，越理越糟。">><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<pass 25>><</if>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">装订账本（技艺不足）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260>><<link [[核对登记簿|MP Job Punishment Laundry 3]]>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpJobLaundryP3Out to "你在晾衣绳和走廊之间问了几个人，最后从一个孩子嘴里问出实情：是有人拿错了摞。管事听完，把责任从你名下划掉，门重新开了。">><<set $mpJobLaundryStrike to 0>><<set $mpJobLaundrySuspended to 0>><<set $mpJobLaundryPenalty to 0>><<stress 2>><<pass 22>><<else>><<set $mpJobLaundryP3Out to "你问了一圈，谁都说没看见。管事听完只是摇头，让你先回去。">><<stress 4>><<pass 22>><</if>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">核对登记簿（手法不足）</span><</if>>
<</if>>
